WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,770
Wait, why don't you move these things in first?

2
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:10,730
General Xiao

3
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:12,730
Old lady, you're welcome

4
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:14,730
How can you salute me at such an old age?

5
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:15,730
Get up quickly

6
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:17,730
If you hadn't sent us the quilt

7
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:20,730
I'm afraid that our institution will freeze to death if we don't starve to death.

8
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:21,730
You're welcome

9
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,730
As the general of our Shazhou City

10
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:25,730
Naturally, I have to consider the basic necessities, food, housing, and transportation of the residents of Shazhou City.

11
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:27,730
This is also my responsibility

12
00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:29,730
Having said that, life is difficult for everyone now

13
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:31,730
Can you find a way to get us quilts?

14
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,730
It's already something unexpected

15
00:00:33,730 --> 00:00:35,730
As an old woman, I don’t have anything to give you.

16
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:37,730
I used to make some nuclear incense

17
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,730
Now I will give you this fragrance

18
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:40,730
Although useless

19
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,730
But it also showed my feelings a little bit

20
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:44,730
General Xiao, our family is profound and impermanent.

21
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:46,730
My mother said you have helped our family so much

22
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:47,730
Be sure to show your confidence

23
00:00:47,730 --> 00:00:49,730
Now I can only give you such a useless thing

24
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:50,730
I hope you don't dislike it

25
00:00:50,730 --> 00:00:51,730
How could you be surprised?

26
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,730
It’s quite difficult in our city these days

27
00:00:53,730 --> 00:00:55,730
I understand your thoughts

28
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:57,730
You'd better go back and have a good rest

29
00:00:57,730 --> 00:00:59,730
Especially the old lady is not young anymore
